et $u={log}_{2}⁡({x}^{2}).$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{2}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}\\,⟹\\,\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{2}\\text{d}u=\\frac{\\text{d}x}{x}.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{log}_{2}⁡({x}^{2})}{x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {log}_{2}⁡({x}^{2})\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{x} \\\\  & =\\int u\\cdot (\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{2}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{2}\\int u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{2}\\cdot \\frac{{u}^{2}}{2}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2{log}_{2}^{2}⁡({x}^{2})}{4}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009028/state.json" "file_sha256" "e0fe9e8494485603aa2f1a0d0e2a29d59ad83a7b6f14b22479a6b3e533506f8e" "basis" 1138 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009028/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-31400" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009028/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "222fe31908a93b53786ab4aa511ab10b01045386db1a176ffaba2a0d129ce6d5" "basis" 1138 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009028/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-31400" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009028/state.json" "file_sha256" "e0fe9e8494485603aa2f1a0d0e2a29d59ad83a7b6f14b22479a6b3e533506f8e" "basis" 1138 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009028/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-31400" "field" "