"field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\int \\frac{1}{x{log}_{3}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14066379/state.json" "file_sha256" "ee3e583868d08c47a945811da8b156576234ca3f836a4b36d50bf3d6f9d76332"} {"question" "q-31397" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let $u={log}_{3}⁡x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}\\,⟹\\,\\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\,\\text{d}u=\\frac{\\text{d}x}{x}.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{x{log}_{3}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{{log}_{3}⁡x}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{x} \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡|u|+C \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡|{log}_{3}⁡x|+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14066379/state.json" "file_sha256" "ee3e583868d08c47a945811da8b156576234ca3f836a4b36d50bf3d6f9d76332"} {"question" "q-31397" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14066379/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "52b552f1b5ca5675f9c96b66b87b6410b4f5dbed10a8239beb8aed69c3f30a7b"} {"question" "q-31397" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14066379/state.json" "file_sha256" "ee3e583868d08c47a945811da8b156576234ca3f836a4b36d50bf3d6f9d76332"} {"question" "q-31397" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡|{log}_{3}⁡x|+C"] ["math" "\\operatorname{ln}⁡|{log}_{3}⁡x|+C"] ["math" "{e}^{3x}+C"] ["math" "{e}^{x}+C"] ["math" "{log}_{3}⁡x+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14066379/state.json" "file_sha256" "ee3e583868d08c47a945811da8b156576234ca3f836a4b36d50bf3d6f9d76332"} {"question" "q-31397" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡|{log}_{3}⁡x|+C"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14066379/state.json" "file_sha256" "ee3e583868d08c47a945811da8b156576234ca3f836a4b36d50bf3d6f9d76332"} {"question" "q-31400" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\int \\frac{{log}_{2}⁡({x}^{2})}{x}\\,\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14066379/state.json" "file_sha256" "ee3e583868d08c47a945811da8b156576234ca3f836a4b36d50bf3d6f9d76332"} {"question" "q-31400" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let $u={log}_{2}⁡({x}^{2}).$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{2}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}\\,⟹\\,\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{2}\\text{d}u=\\frac{\\text{d}x}{x}.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{log}_{2}⁡({x}^{2})}{x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {log}_{2}⁡({x}^{2})\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{x} \\\\  & =\\int u\\cdot (\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{2}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{2}\\int u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{2}\\cdot \\frac{{u}^{2}}{2}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2{log}_{2}^{2}⁡({x}^{2})}{4}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 