stion/problem" "value" "What is the value of  ${\\int }_{2}^{4}\\frac{3{log}_{2}⁡({x}^{2})}{\\sqrt{2}x}\\,\\text{d}x?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14066379/state.json" "file_sha256" "ee3e583868d08c47a945811da8b156576234ca3f836a4b36d50bf3d6f9d76332"} {"question" "q-31648" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let $u={log}_{2}⁡({x}^{2}).$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}\\cdot 2x=\\frac{2}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}\\,⟹\\,\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{2}\\,\\text{d}u=\\frac{\\text{d}x}{x}.\n$$\n\nCalculating the limits for $u$ gives the following:\n\n| $x$ | $2$ | $4$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $2$ | $4$ |\n\nWe now substitute and evaluate as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{2}^{4}\\frac{3{log}_{2}⁡({x}^{2})}{\\sqrt{2}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{2}}{\\int }_{2}^{4}{log}_{2}⁡({x}^{2})\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{x} \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{2}}{\\int }_{2}^{4}u\\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{2}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{2}}\\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{2}{\\int }_{2}^{4}u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{3\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{2\\sqrt{2}}\\cdot \\frac{{u}^{2}}{2}{|}_{2}^{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{3\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{4\\sqrt{2}}\\cdot (16-4) \\\\  & =\\frac{9\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14066379/state.json" "file_sha256" "ee3e583868d08c47a945811da8b156576234ca3f836a4b36d50bf3d6f9d76332"} {"question" "q-31648" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14066379/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "52b552f1b5ca5675f9c96b66b87b6410b4f5dbed10a8239beb8aed69c3f30a7b"} {"question" "q-31648" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14066379/state.json" "file_sha256" "ee3e583868d08c47a945811da8b156576234ca3f836a4b36d50bf3d6f9d76332"} {"question" "q-31648" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\frac{3\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{\\sqrt{2}}"] ["math" "\\frac{9\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{\\sqrt{2}}"] ["math" "\\frac{9\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|}{\\sqrt{2}}"] ["math" "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{2\\sqrt{x}}"] ["math" "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|}{2\\sqrt{2}}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14066379/state.json" "file_sha256" "ee3e583868d08c47a945811da8b156576234ca3f836a4b36d50bf3d6f9d76332"} {"question" "q-31648" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{9\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{\\sqrt{2}}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14066379/state.json" "file_sha256" "ee3e583868d08c47a945811da8b156576234ca3f836a4b36d50bf3d6f9d76332"} {"question" "q-31669" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the value of ${\\int }_{1}^{5}\\frac{7{log}_{5}⁡(5x)}{x}\\,\\text{d}x?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14066379/state.json" "file_sha256" "ee3e583868d08c47a945811da8b156576234ca3f836a4b36d50bf3d6f9d76332"} {"question" "q-31669" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let $u={log}_{5}⁡(5x).$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{5x\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}\\cdot 5=\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}\\,⟹\\,\\operatorname{ln}⁡5\\,\\text{d}u=\\frac{\\text{d}x}{x}.\n$$\n\nCalculating the limits for $u$ gives the following:\n\n| $x$ | $1$ | $5$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n\nWe now substitute and evaluate as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{5}\\frac{7{log}_{5}⁡(5x)}{x}\\,\\text{d}x & =7{\\int }_{1}^{5}{log}_{5}⁡(5x)\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{x} \\\\  & =7{\\int }_{1}^{2}u\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡5\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =7\\operatorname{ln}⁡5{\\int }_{1}^{2}u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =7\\operatorname{ln}⁡5\\cdot \\frac{{u}^{2}}{2}{|}_{1}^{2} \\\\  & =7\\operatorname{ln}⁡5\\cdot (\\frac{4}{2}-\\frac{1}{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{21\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14066379/state.json" "file_sha256" "ee3e583868d08c47a945811da8b156576234ca3f836a4b36d50bf3d6f9d76332"} {"question" "q-31669" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14066379/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "52b552f1b5ca5675f9c96b66b87b6410b4f5dbed10a8239beb8aed69c3f30a7b"} {"question" "q-31669" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14066379/state.json" "file_sha256" "ee3e583868d08c47a945811da8b156576234ca3f836a4b36d50bf3d6f9d76332"} {"question" "q-31669" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\frac{21\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}{2}"] ["math" "\\frac{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}{2\\sqrt{5}}"] ["math" "\\frac{31\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}{\\sqrt{5}}"] ["math" "\\frac{33\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}{\\sqrt{5}}"] ["math" "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}{3}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14066379/state.json" "file_sha256" "ee3e583868d08c47a945811da8b156576234ca3f836a4b36d50bf3d6f9d76332"} {"question" "q-31669" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{21\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}{2}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14066379/state.json" "file_sha256" "ee3e583868d08c47a945811da8b156576234ca3f836a4b36d50bf3d6f9d76332"} {"question" "q-114021" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\int \\frac{{log}_{7}⁡x}{2x}\\,\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14066379/state.json" "file_sha256" "ee3e583868d08c47a945811da8b156576234ca3f836a4b36d50bf3d6f9d76332"} {"question" "q-114021" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let $u={log}_{7}⁡x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡7}\\,⟹\\,\\operatorname{ln}⁡7\\,\\text{d}u=\\frac{\\text{d}x}{x}.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{log}_{7}⁡x}{2x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int {log}_{7}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{x} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int u\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡7\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡7}{2}\\int u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡7}{2}\\cdot \\frac{{u}^{2}}{2}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡7}{4}\\cdot {log}_{7}^{2}⁡x+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14066379/state.json" "file_sha256" "ee3e583868d08c47a945811da8b156576234ca3f836a4b36d50bf3d6f9d76332"} {"question" "q-114021" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-worker